WEBVTT

00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:23.050
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:30.190
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:36.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:42.840
I was searching for your smile

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:50.210
With our memories fading

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:57.290
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:04.190
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:11.410
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:37.650
Why did I return to this world after 3,000 years?

00:01:37.650 --> 00:01:42.640
So that I could defeat Dartz and change the future of the world!

00:01:43.060 --> 00:01:47.530
The nameless card freed the Legendary Knights!

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:49.500
End Dartz!

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:52.830
What?  Divine Serpent Geh?

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:55.300
It has infinite attack points?

00:01:56.360 --> 00:02:02.370
Infinite Attack Points  Divine Serpent Geh

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:06.900
Vanish, Dark Magician Girl!

00:02:08.550 --> 00:02:12.190
I activate Legendary Knight Hermos's effect!

00:02:13.710 --> 00:02:17.550
Absorb the power of the monsters in the graveyard!

00:02:19.850 --> 00:02:21.780
Freedom Sword!

00:02:26.460 --> 00:02:29.780
By gaining Obnoxious Celtic Guard's effect...

00:02:29.780 --> 00:02:33.740
...it negates attack points that are 1900 or higher!

00:02:33.740 --> 00:02:34.700
What?

00:02:34.700 --> 00:02:40.440
We, the three knights, will protect our master with our lives!

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:42.810
My turn!

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:51.180
Dartz!  It’s finally time to end it between us!

00:02:51.990 --> 00:02:54.560
Geh has infinite attack points.

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:57.080
It’s impossible to exceed it.

00:02:57.080 --> 00:03:04.560
My partner, Jonouchi, Kaiba, Mai, Rafael, everyone.

00:03:05.050 --> 00:03:08.530
Your thoughts are now one.

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:13.980
Legendary Knight Critias and Hermos, attack Divine Serpent Geh!

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:19.080
Wisdom Sword!

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:25.190
Freedom Sword!

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:30.020
Pointless.

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:31.520
Are you sure?

00:03:35.490 --> 00:03:41.440
No way!  Nothing can be more than Geh's infinite attack points!

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:45.800
Dartz, if you believe the darkness in our hearts is infinite...

00:03:45.800 --> 00:03:48.900
...then the power of our bond is also infinite!

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:54.370
Critias’s sword absorbed Attack Guidance Barrier's power!

00:03:55.490 --> 00:04:00.010
It shifts the attack to another monster!

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:04.320
So the attack against Geh shifts to Hermos!

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:06.200
What?

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:09.960
I activate Legendary Knight Hermos's effect!

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:13.900
It absorbs three monsters from my deck!

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:17.600
And reflects back triple the attack points it took!

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:23.150
No way!

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:31.080
Yes.  Critias and Hermos formed an infinite attack point loop!

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:36.050
An infinity that's greater than Geh’s attack points?

00:04:36.050 --> 00:04:37.640
Here I go, Dartz!

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:40.480
Legendary Knight Timaeus attacks!

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:50.100
Timaeus's effect lets it to combine with other monsters on the field to become a new monster!

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:55.040
The power of our bond will open a new future!

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:58.360
Gain the power that's greater than infinity!

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:01.480
Timaeus the Knight of Destiny!

00:05:05.010 --> 00:05:06.120
What?

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:11.560
Behold the moment the power of our bond breaks through the darkness!

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:19.510
Justice Sword!

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:30.440
What’s that?

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:38.320
It can’t be...

00:05:38.320 --> 00:05:39.450
I'm…

00:06:03.780 --> 00:06:06.440
Dartz!  I won the duel!

00:06:06.440 --> 00:06:08.560
Release everyone's souls!

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:16.480
Dartz!

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:26.540
What?

00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:33.250
What's that?

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:14.020
Mai!

00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:17.320
Pegasus!

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:27.630
Chosen duelists, rejoin us!

00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:36.670
What’s this?

00:07:59.160 --> 00:07:59.960
Mokuba!

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:02.620
Mokuba!  Wake up!

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:05.740
Big brother?

00:08:05.740 --> 00:08:07.280
Big brother!

00:08:08.820 --> 00:08:11.040
Kaiba!  Mokuba!

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:15.680
Anzu!  Hey, Anzu!

00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:17.470
Wake up!

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:24.090
Honda?  Weren't we...

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:30.820
Anzu?

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:33.660
Yugi, is that you?

00:08:40.180 --> 00:08:42.370
Yugi...  Yugi!

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:43.840
Anzu!

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:44.860
Yugi!

00:08:44.860 --> 00:08:46.990
You're really back!

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:49.210
You’re choking me, Anzu!

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:50.840
Yugi!

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:52.210
Jonouchi!

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:54.310
Jonouchi!

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:55.500
Yugi!

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:58.200
We’re back to this world!

00:08:58.200 --> 00:08:59.700
Jonouchi!

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:00.950
Jonouchi!

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:02.920
Yugi!  Jonouchi!

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:07.840
Partner, we finally meet again.

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:09.760
My other self!

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:16.400
Dartz vanished into the darkness, and the three Legendary Knights brought your souls back.

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:19.080
But it’s too early to celebrate.

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:20.720
My other self...

00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:25.650
Since your souls are back, so must everyone else's.

00:09:25.650 --> 00:09:27.800
No, they're not.

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:31.530
We’re the only ones who've returned.

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:34.160
Everyone else’s souls are still…

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:35.460
Master Seto!

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:36.890
Big trouble!

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:44.780
What’s that?

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:11.240
That’s…

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:12.590
Is it Atlantis?

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:16.030
It really came out of the ocean?

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:18.030
Is there any other explanation?

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:22.140
Dartz’s god must still be alive.

00:10:22.140 --> 00:10:24.520
And has everyone's souls.

00:10:24.520 --> 00:10:27.750
Unless we defeat it, we can't save Mai or Valon.

00:10:28.430 --> 00:10:30.980
Nor Amelda or many other souls.

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:42.790
What's this?

00:10:43.220 --> 00:10:44.410
Big trouble!

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:48.730
The earthquake created a tidal wave that's moving towards the Atlantic coast.

00:10:49.230 --> 00:10:53.160
When it hits the coast, it'll be 200 meters tall!

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:58.320
It will reach the East Coast in one hour!

00:10:58.620 --> 00:10:59.770
What?

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:03.190
We have to go there to end this.

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:04.920
But how?

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:06.710
By helicopter?

00:11:06.710 --> 00:11:11.430
Wait.  There may be another path to get there.

00:11:11.430 --> 00:11:13.620
The portal Dartz went through.

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:17.790
That should work.  I'm going.

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:19.370
Yugi!

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:21.520
Yugi, I'm going too!

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:22.730
Jonouchi!

00:11:23.050 --> 00:11:27.640
You can't!  You just got your souls back!

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:32.060
Doma is too much for us to handle!

00:11:32.060 --> 00:11:36.220
Anzu, you know that’s not true.

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:42.620
Unless we go and fight alongside the Duel Monsters, the god of Orichalcos can't be stopped.

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:45.410
Yugi's right.

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:49.490
I want to restore Valon and Mai's souls.

00:11:49.490 --> 00:11:54.990
Since I was captured, I know that it’s scary and lonely.

00:11:54.990 --> 00:12:01.870
But I believed that Jonouchi, Kaiba and my other self would save me.

00:12:01.870 --> 00:12:06.840
Those who are still captured also believe that we'll save them.

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:09.240
Yugi...

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:11.180
That's why we have to go.

00:12:11.180 --> 00:12:12.900
Big trouble, President!

00:12:15.010 --> 00:12:20.320
A huge tidal wave will hit East Coast cities in one hour!

00:12:20.320 --> 00:12:21.460
What?

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:43.230
Big brother!

00:12:43.230 --> 00:12:44.240
Kaiba!

00:12:44.600 --> 00:12:46.960
You wait here.

00:12:46.960 --> 00:12:50.680
My anger won't subside until I finish Dartz!

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:51.880
Wait, Kaiba!

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:55.180
I won't let you go alone!

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:59.410
I don't need help from a chump!

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:00.680
What?

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:02.500
Yugi!

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:06.570
Anzu, wait a sec.

00:13:06.570 --> 00:13:08.430
I’ll switch with my other self.

00:13:10.300 --> 00:13:12.640
You’re fine as is.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:17.240
Yugi, make sure you come back.

00:13:17.240 --> 00:13:20.190
Tell that to the other Yugi too.

00:13:20.400 --> 00:13:21.960
Anzu...

00:13:23.180 --> 00:13:25.120
I promise to return!

00:13:25.920 --> 00:13:28.950
You better, Yugi and Jonouchi!

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:31.120
Big brother, I'm going too!

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:31.900
You can't!

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:35.500
Let's trust them and wait.

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:45.700
Can this be?

00:13:49.790 --> 00:13:51.240
A God Card!

00:13:56.110 --> 00:13:59.080
Obelisk!  Ra!  Slifer!

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:01.650
We finally have them again.

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:06.590
But their powers have been stolen.

00:14:06.960 --> 00:14:10.970
But I’m sure these cards will help us.

00:14:10.970 --> 00:14:13.170
Yeah.  Let's hurry, partner!

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:20.210
The soul cards on the wall are gone.

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:23.210
Did that freak eat them all?

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:25.730
Jonouchi!  Kaiba!

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:28.240
Hermos!

00:14:28.240 --> 00:14:29.080
Critias!

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:32.080
This card gives me confidence!

00:14:32.960 --> 00:14:35.020
This card always belonged to me.

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:44.440
Come, chosen duelists.

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:45.300
Dartz!

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:46.890
Let’s go!

00:14:46.890 --> 00:14:48.830
You don’t need to tell me.

00:15:09.720 --> 00:15:11.160
Where are we?

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:14.090
Are we in Atlantis?

00:15:14.470 --> 00:15:16.460
Dartz is here somewhere.

00:15:16.460 --> 00:15:18.410
Hey, look at that!

00:15:24.450 --> 00:15:26.280
Is Dartz there?

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:32.920
Dartz!

00:15:44.530 --> 00:15:45.520
There!

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:00.240
That’s…

00:16:05.040 --> 00:16:06.180
Dartz!

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:23.420
What's going on?

00:16:23.420 --> 00:16:26.370
Dartz's flesh was already gone?

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:31.450
Took you long enough, chosen duelists.

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:32.340
Dartz!

00:16:33.700 --> 00:16:36.270
My god has already resurrected.

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:43.020
Impossible!  The god of Orichalcos can't resurrect without our souls!

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:48.660
It's true that it hasn't completely revived, but I can offer my own soul to compensate.

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:50.350
What?

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:12.410
What’s going on?

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:19.280
What?

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:26.990
That’s the god of Orichalcos!

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:28.440
It's huge!

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:35.760
That’s…

00:17:35.760 --> 00:17:36.980
Dartz!

00:17:36.980 --> 00:17:39.690
He sacrificed his own soul!

00:17:39.690 --> 00:17:45.140
Chosen duelists, no one can stop this god.

00:17:45.140 --> 00:17:48.790
Be quiet!  You're a shadow of your own self!

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:53.080
And I'll be the one to end you, you ugly monster!

00:17:54.820 --> 00:17:56.600
Can you?

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:03.950
We'll lose unless we go all out from the start!

00:18:05.350 --> 00:18:06.730
Let's go!

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:09.740
Come out, Dark Magician!

00:18:09.740 --> 00:18:11.640
Summoned Skull!

00:18:12.170 --> 00:18:13.520
Kuriboh!

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:16.440
Come, Flame Swordsman!

00:18:16.870 --> 00:18:18.100
Jinzo!

00:18:18.100 --> 00:18:20.120
Red-Eyes B. Dragon!

00:18:21.170 --> 00:18:24.490
Come out, Blue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon!

00:18:24.980 --> 00:18:26.360
Gadget Soldier!

00:18:26.360 --> 00:18:27.780
Vorse Raider!

00:18:29.590 --> 00:18:30.830
And...

00:18:30.830 --> 00:18:33.270
Come out, nameless dragons!

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:35.190
Lend us your power!

00:18:47.070 --> 00:18:49.210
Show your true forms!

00:18:49.210 --> 00:18:51.050
Legend of Heart!

00:19:00.760 --> 00:19:03.760
They're the legendary dragons' true forms!

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:07.870
Monsters!  Go!

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:28.550
Superconductive Black Magic!

00:19:28.550 --> 00:19:30.480
Cyber Energy Black Flare!

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:34.780
Ultimate Burst!  Fire all rockets!

00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:54.310
Timaeus absorbs Kuriboh's multiplication and self-destruction effects!

00:19:57.300 --> 00:19:59.480
Feel my sword!

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:01.210
Justice Sword!

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:10.740
We did it!

00:20:11.650 --> 00:20:13.060
Everyone will be saved!

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:19.430
What?

00:20:20.160 --> 00:20:21.560
No way!

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:26.090
You must be joking!

00:20:26.090 --> 00:20:28.800
Our attacks didn’t hurt it at all?

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:44.820
Hold up!  If we take that attack...

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:54.490
Legendary Knight Timaeus absorbs Big Shield Gardna's effect!

00:20:54.490 --> 00:20:56.460
Activate your effect!

00:21:16.940 --> 00:21:19.560
One blast destroyed our monsters!

00:21:19.560 --> 00:21:20.400
Damn!

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:23.660
At this rate, we can't win!

00:21:29.400 --> 00:21:30.690
Here it comes again!

00:21:36.650 --> 00:21:37.570
What's that?

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:42.840
This glow...

00:21:58.640 --> 00:22:07.520
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:08.050 --> 00:22:15.890
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:17.620 --> 00:22:27.050
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:36.540
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:37.140 --> 00:22:45.600
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:46.380 --> 00:22:51.110
I'll live feeling them

00:22:51.720 --> 00:22:56.260
For me to be me

00:22:56.260 --> 00:23:04.750
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:05.430 --> 00:23:10.390
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:10.910 --> 00:23:20.050
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:26.410 --> 00:23:29.860
They finally defeated Dartz... is what we thought.

00:23:29.860 --> 00:23:35.240
Dartz sacrificed his soul to resurrect the god of Orichalcos.

00:23:35.240 --> 00:23:39.780
The three Legendary Knights are powerless against its overwhelming power.

00:23:39.780 --> 00:23:44.610
There's little time left until the giant tidal waves strike worldwide.

00:23:44.610 --> 00:23:48.600
But we still believe that Yugi won't lose!

00:23:48.600 --> 00:23:51.050
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh:
Battle of the Gods

00:23:51.050 --> 00:23:52.610
Duel, standby!
